🛠 Installation & Setup
1️⃣ Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/your-org/erp-api.git
cd erp-api

2️⃣ Install dependencies
npm install

3️⃣ Create .env file
PORT=5000

DATABASE_URL="mysql://root:password@localhost:3306/erp"

JWT_SECRET="your_jwt_secret_key"
JWT_EXPIRES_IN="7d"

EMAIL_USER="your-email@gmail.com"
EMAIL_PASS="your-email-password"
EMAIL_FROM="ERP System <your-email@gmail.com>"

FRONTEND_URL="http://localhost:5173"

4️⃣ Prepare Database

Create MySQL database:

CREATE DATABASE erp;


Run Prisma migration:

npm run prisma:migrate


Generate Prisma client:

npm run prisma:generate


(Optional) Seed database:

npm run seed

5️⃣ Run API
Development:
npm run dev

Production:
npm start


The API runs at:

http://localhost:5000

🔐 Authentication & Roles
JWT-based authentication

Tokens are stored in cookies + Authorization header.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Supported Roles

ADMIN

HR

MANAGER

EMPLOYEE

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Middleware
Middleware	Description
authRequired	Ensures user is authenticated
requireRole("ADMIN")	Restrict endpoint by role(s)
multer.single("file")	Handles CSV uploads
📌 API Modules
✔ Auth Module
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/auth/login	Login user
POST	/auth/register (OPTIONAL)	Create user
GET	/auth/me	Get logged-in user
POST	/auth/refresh	Refresh token
POST	/auth/logout	Logout
✔ Holiday Module
Method	Endpoint	Role	Description
GET	/holidays?year=2025	ALL	List holidays
POST	/holidays	ADMIN, HR	Create holiday
PUT	/holidays/:id	ADMIN, HR	Update holiday
DELETE	/holidays/:id	ADMIN, HR	Delete holiday
POST	/holidays/bulk	ADMIN, HR	Bulk Upload .csv
Allowed CSV Format:
date,name,isCommon,country
01/01/2025,New Year,true,UK

Filename must include year:
holidays2025.csv
holidays-2024.csv


Invalid filename → ❌ “Filename should include valid year”

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

✔ Employees Module
Method	Endpoint	Role	Description
GET	/employees	ADMIN, HR	List employees
POST	/employees	ADMIN, HR	Create employee
PUT	/employees/:id	ADMIN, HR	Update
DELETE	/employees/:id	ADMIN, HR	Remove
✔ Projects Module
Method	Endpoint	Role
GET	/projects	ALL
POST	/projects	ADMIN, MANAGER
PUT	/projects/:id	ADMIN, MANAGER
DELETE	/projects/:id	ADMIN
✔ Tasks Module (Optional depending on your code)
