(I can generate this too if needed.)

❗ Common Issues & Fixes
❌ Prisma Client Not Found

Run:

npm run prisma:generate

❌ Migration fails

Ensure DB exists

Ensure .env DATABASE_URL is correct

❌ Bulk upload failing

Ensure CSV has correct structure

Ensure filename includes year

Ensure only .csv used

🎯 Production Deployment Notes

Use PM2 or Docker (if needed later)

Setup Nginx reverse proxy

Enable HTTPS

Use environment variables

Configure CORS for UI domain